.man.registerFile ("qunit.q";"";".qunit";"Unit testing for q similar to junit, cunit etc.       <br/> Tests should be specified in their own file/namespace       <br/> Actual test functions should then be named test* and contain assertions.       <br/> <br/> Tests can either pass/fail/exception. Failure is caused by an assert failing. You have the option of configuring qunit to halt on failed assertions allowing you to step into the code at that point. .");
